  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1400</x>
      <y>805</y>
      <w>300</w>
      <h>290</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>UsedCarAgent (panel A) creates
PromptBuilder and ResponseParser;
uses ReportSchema.json(...).
It holds DataQualityChecker;
creates ChecklistPlanner locally.
Neither checker/planner is a Tool.

ResponseParser also calls:
RiskAgeValidator.validate(...)
ComparisonNarrative.validate(...).

Other schemas cover listing,
risk, comparison, checklist
and clarification responses.
fontsize=16
bg=white</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
