    <panel_attributes>Records expose generated accessors; selected private final components are shown, not setters. Static methods are underlined.
Failure keeps evidence but may leave interpretation null. Report categories: Strong Candidate / Consider with Caution / High Risk / Insufficient Information.
halign=left
fontsize=16</panel_attributes>
